  "name": "Create Audit Log",
  "api_name": "audit_0awadbvy",
  "ai_description": "\nWhen manually run on a 'Document Sets' record, this 2-step automation creates an audit trail for document classification changes. The workflow begins by creating a new related record in the 'Audit Logs' object. Immediately after, it updates this new audit log record, setting its 'Initial Document Type' field with the value from the triggering 'Document Sets' record's 'Document Type' field, in addition to six other field updates.\n",
