    "description": "The Document Sets object stores and categorizes financial documents for mortgage transactions, classifying them by type like 'Appraisal' or 'W2'. It tracks classification status, records an execution date, and identifies multi-document files. Each set is linked to a primary Deal, Party, and Contact, and supports parent-child hierarchies for grouping related documents.",
